# Cloudflare Static Asset Exclusions
# Prevents server-side worker code, documentation, and configuration files from being served as static web assets

_worker.js
wrangler.json
.assetsignore
.gitignore
.env
.env.example
*.md
*.bat
*.ps1
execution/
directives/
supabase/
scratch/
desktop.ini
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
